    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967590/extras/575aecced89eb3601828493909c181c0.avif?t=1717704041\" width=616 height=154 /></span><br><br>This is an open-world story about VAN CAT (that's his name, no affiliations with vehicles), a duduk player from a regular family, who tracks down his CULT-LEADING UNCLE through spacetime to talk him out of creating a WORLDWIDE DICTATORSHIP!!!<br><br>Explore three surreal, immersive worlds swirling with music, light and color, inspired by the Ottoman Empire, Soviet Armenia and modern day Armenia to rescue your best friend, talk some sense to your weird, weird uncle, and destroy his time machine.<br><br>This Game Includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique visuals by the developer herself<br></li><li> Beautiful music<br></li><li> Sunlight and other cute lighting to make it feel like you're actually outside and touching grass<br></li><li> Battling mechanics<br></li><li> Puzzle solving, using pattern recognition to unlock doors and find hidden keys...<br></li><li> Open world exploration, I don't want to control you :D</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967590/extras/f8db9d10d3f47d059ac579893c11afd8.avif?t=1717704041\" width=616 height=155 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967590/extras/575aecced89eb3601828493909c181c0.avif?t=1717704041\" width=616 height=154 /></span><br><br>This is an open-world story about VAN CAT (that's his name, no affiliations with vehicles), a duduk player from a regular family, who tracks down his CULT-LEADING UNCLE through spacetime to talk him out of creating a WORLDWIDE DICTATORSHIP!!!<br><br>Explore three surreal, immersive worlds swirling with music, light and color, inspired by the Ottoman Empire, Soviet Armenia and modern day Armenia to rescue your best friend, talk some sense to your weird, weird uncle, and destroy his time machine.<br><br>This Game Includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique visuals by the developer herself<br></li><li> Beautiful music<br></li><li> Sunlight and other cute lighting to make it feel like you're actually outside and touching grass<br></li><li> Battling mechanics<br></li><li> Puzzle solving, using pattern recognition to unlock doors and find hidden keys...<br></li><li> Open world exploration, I don't want to control you :D</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967590/extras/f8db9d10d3f47d059ac579893c11afd8.avif?t=1717704041\" width=616 height=155 /></span>",
